Action Input: {}

Thought: With the DBE formula, I can calculate the degree of unsaturation once I have the molecular formula. To proceed, I will use the mass spectrometry data to generate possible molecular formulas and then calculate the DBE for each. This will help in identifying the correct molecular structure. I will use the tool to obtain isomers from the molecular formula, which will help in identifying potential SMILES strings.
