Thought: I have obtained a list of potential isomers for the molecular formula C16H12O2. To identify the correct SMILES string, I should validate these SMILES strings against the experimental data. I will use the carbon NMR spectra to compare the chemical shifts with those expected for each isomer, as this can provide a clear distinction between different structural isomers.
Action: carbon_nmr_spectra
